<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia sees 17 pct credit expansion in 97/98.</title>
<headline>Indonesia sees 17 pct credit expansion in 97/98.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia has forecast credit expansion of 17.0 percent to 331.93 trillion rupiah in fiscal 1997/98, the Finance Ministry said.  </p>
<p>In data made available ahead of President Suharto's 1997/98 budget speech to parliament on Monday, it said the country's bank credit grew 16.3 percent to 281.99 trillion rupiah in November.</p>
<p>Indonesia's credit expansion growth was forecast to rise 16 percent to 276.45 trillion rupiah in the 1996/97 (April/March) fiscal year.</p>
<p>($1=2,362 rupiah)</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
